msgstr "Izlazno polje"

#: include/global_form.php lib/html_utility.php
msgid "Not Selected"
msgstr "Nije odabrano"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When data is gathered, the data for this field will be put into this data source."
msgstr "Pri prikupljanju podataka, podaci za ovo polje bit će stavljeni u ovaj izvor podataka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a name for this GPRINT preset, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Unesite naziv za ovu GPRINT predefiniranu postavku, pazite da ga prepoznajete."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Text"
msgstr "GPRINT tekst"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter the custom GPRINT string here."
msgstr "Ovdje unesite prilagođeni GPRINT niz."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Common Options"
msgstr "Uobičajene opcije"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Title (--title)"
msgstr "Naslov (--title)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name that is printed on the graph.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Kadupul documentation."
msgstr "Naziv koji se ispisuje na grafikonu.  Može sadržavati zamjenske varijable kao što su |host_description| ili |query_fieldName|.  Za kompletan spisak podržanih zamjenskih oznaka pogledajte Kadupul dokumentaciju."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Vertical Label (--vertical-label)"
msgstr "Vertikalna oznaka (--vertical-label)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label vertically printed to the left of the graph."
msgstr "Oznaka ispisana vertikalno lijevo od grafikona."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Image Format (--imgformat)"
msgstr "Format slike (--imgformat)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of graph that is generated; PNG, GIF or SVG.  The selection of graph image type is very RRDtool dependent."
msgstr "Tip grafikona koji se generiše; PNG, GIF ili SVG.  Odabir tipa slike grafikona u velikoj mjeri zavisi od RRDtool-a."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Height (--height)"
msgstr "Visina (--height)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The height (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Visina (u pikselima) područja grafa unutar grafa. Ovo područje ne uključuje legendu, legende osi ni naslov."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Width (--width)"
msgstr "Širina (--width)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The width (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Širina (u pikselima) područja grafa unutar grafa. Ovo područje ne uključuje legendu, legende osi ni naslov."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Base Value (--base)"
msgstr "Osnovna vrijednost (--base)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Should be set to 1024 for memory and 1000 for traffic measurements."
msgstr "Treba biti postavljeno na 1024 za memoriju i 1000 za mjerenja prometa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Slope Mode (--slope-mode)"
msgstr "Način nagiba (--slope-mode)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Using Slope Mode evens out the shape of the graphs at the expense of some on screen resolution."
msgstr "Korištenje režima nagiba izglađuje oblik grafikona nauštrb dijela rezolucije na ekranu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Scaling Options"
msgstr "Opcije skaliranja"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale"
msgstr "Automatsko skaliranje"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When enabled, the selected Auto Scale Option determines which limits RRDtool uses: --alt-autoscale ignores both limits, --alt-autoscale-max keeps the lower limit, --alt-autoscale-min keeps the upper limit, and --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits) keeps both limits. When disabled, the configured lower and upper limits are used directly. Rigid Boundaries controls whether values outside those limits expand the graph range."
msgstr "Kada je omogućeno, odabrana opcija automatskog skaliranja određuje koje granice RRDtool koristi: --alt-autoscale zanemaruje obje granice, --alt-autoscale-max zadržava donju granicu, --alt-autoscale-min zadržava gornju granicu, a --alt-autoscale (prihvatajući obje granice) zadržava obje granice. Kada je onemogućeno, direktno se koriste konfigurisane donja i gornja granica. Krute granice kontrolišu da li vrijednosti izvan tih granica proširuju opseg grafikona."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale Options"
msgstr "Opcije automatskog skaliranja"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use <br> --alt-autoscale to scale to the absolute minimum and maximum <br> --alt-autoscale-max to scale to the maximum value, using a given lower limit <br> --alt-autoscale-min to scale to the minimum value, using a given upper limit <br> --alt-autoscale (with limits) to scale using both lower and upper limits (RRDtool default) <br>"
msgstr "Koristite <br> --alt-autoscale za skaliranje na apsolutni minimum i maksimum <br> --alt-autoscale-max za skaliranje na maksimalnu vrijednost uz zadatu donju granicu <br> --alt-autoscale-min za skaliranje na minimalnu vrijednost uz zadatu gornju granicu <br> --alt-autoscale (s granicama) za skaliranje korištenjem i donje i gornje granice (podrazumijevano za RRDtool) <br>"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (ignoring given limits)"
msgstr "Koristi --alt-autoscale (zanemarujući zadate granice)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-max (accepting a lower limit)"
msgstr "Koristi --alt-autoscale-max (prihvaćajući donju granicu)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-min (accepting an upper limit)"
msgstr "Koristi --alt-autoscale-min (prihvaćajući gornju granicu)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits, RRDtool default)"
msgstr "Koristi --alt-autoscale (prihvatajući obje granice, podrazumijevano za RRDtool)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Logarithmic Scaling (--logarithmic)"
msgstr "Logaritamsko skaliranje (--logarithmic)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Koristi logaritamsko skaliranje y-osi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"
msgstr "SI jedinice za logaritamsko skaliranje (--units=si)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Koristite SI jedinice za logaritamsko skaliranje umjesto eksponencijalne notacije.<br> Napomena: Linearni grafikoni podrazumijevano koriste SI notaciju."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Rigid Boundaries Mode (--rigid)"
msgstr "Način krutih granica (--rigid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Ne proširuj donju i gornju granicu ako grafikon sadrži vrijednost izvan važećeg opsega."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Gornja granica (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Maksimalna vertikalna vrijednost grafikona."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Donja granica (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Minimalna vertikalna vrijednost grafikona."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti mreže"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Vrijednost jedinične mreže (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Postavlja vrijednost eksponenta na osi Y za brojeve. Napomena: ova je mogućnost zastarjela i zamijenjena mogućnošću --y-grid.  U ovoj se mogućnosti linije mreže osi Y pojavljuju u svakom koraku mreže.  Oznake se postavljaju svake linije prema faktoru oznaka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Vrijednost eksponenta jedinice (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Kadupul should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Koju jedinicu Kadupul treba koristiti na osi Y. Upotrijebite 3 za prikaz svega u \"k\" ili -6 za prikaz svega u \"u\" (mikro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Dužina jedinice (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Koliko znamenki RRDtool treba pretpostaviti za oznake osi Y? Možda ćete morati upotrijebiti ovu mogućnost da biste osigurali dovoljno prostora nakon što počnete mijenjati oznake osi Y."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Bez prilagodbe mreži (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Da bi se izbjegli efekti zamućenja usljed anti-aliasinga, RRDtool poravnava tačke na piksele rezolucije uređaja, što daje oštriji izgled. Ako vam to ne odgovara, ovim prekidačem možete isključiti to ponašanje.<br><strong>Napomena: </strong>Prilagođavanje mreži podrazumijevano je isključeno za PDF, EPS i SVG izlaz."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Alternativna Y mreža (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Algoritam osigurava da uvijek imate mrežu, da ima dovoljno, ali ne previše linija mreže, te da je mreža metrička. Ovaj će parametar također osigurati prikaz dovoljno decimala čak i ako vaš graf ide od 69,998 do 70,001.<br><strong>Napomena: </strong>Ovaj parametar može ometati mogućnosti --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti osi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Desna os (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "Druga će se os nacrtati desno od grafa. Povezana je s lijevom osi pomoću parametara skale i pomaka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Oznaka desne osi (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Oznaka za desnu os."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Format desne osi (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Podrazumijevano se format oznaka osi određuje automatski.  Ako to želite uraditi sami, koristite ovu opciju s istim %lf argumentima koje poznajete iz naredbi PRINT i GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Formater desne osi (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you set up the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Kada podešavate označavanje desne ose, primijenite pravilo na format podataka.  Podržani formati uključuju \"numeric\", gdje se podaci tretiraju kao brojevi, \"timestamp\", gdje se vrijednosti tumače kao UNIX vremenske oznake (broj sekundi od januara 1970.) i izražavaju u strftime formatu (podrazumijevano je \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Pogledajte i --units-length i --right-axis-format.  Na kraju, \"duration\", gdje se vrijednosti tumače kao trajanje u milisekundama.  Formatiranje slijedi pravila za PRINT/GPRINT s kvalifikatorom valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Formater lijeve osi (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you set up the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Kada podešavate označavanje lijeve ose, primijenite pravilo na format podataka.  Podržani formati uključuju \"numeric\", gdje se podaci tretiraju kao brojevi, \"timestamp\", gdje se vrijednosti tumače kao UNIX vremenske oznake (broj sekundi od januara 1970.) i izražavaju u strftime formatu (podrazumijevano je \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Pogledajte i --units-length.  Na kraju, \"duration\", gdje se vrijednosti tumače kao trajanje u milisekundama.  Formatiranje slijedi pravila za PRINT/GPRINT s kvalifikatorom valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti legende"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Automatsko poravnanje"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Popunite tekst tako da se legenda i podaci grafikona uvijek poravnaju. Napomena: ovo može uzrokovati duže iscrtavanje grafikona zbog većeg opterećenja. Također, automatsko popunjavanje možda neće biti tačno na svim vrstama grafikona, dosljedno označavanje obično pomaže."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Dinamičke oznake (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Crtaj oznake linija kao liniju."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Prisili legendu pravila (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Prisili stvaranje legendi HRULE i VRULE."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Širina tabulatora (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Podrazumijevano je širina tabulatora 40 piksela; koristite ovu opciju da je promijenite."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Položaj legende (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Postavite legendu na datu stranu grafikona."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
msgstr "Smjer legende (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend items in the given vertical order."
msgstr "Postavite stavke legende datim vertikalnim redoslijedom."

#: include/global_form.php lib/api_aggregate.php lib/html.php
msgid "Graph Item Type"
msgstr "Vrsta stavke grafa"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented visually on the graph."
msgstr "Kako su podaci za ovu stavku vizualno prikazani na grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The data source to use for this graph item."
msgstr "Izvor podataka koji se koristi za ovu stavku grafa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The color to use for the legend."
msgstr "Boja koja se koristi za legendu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Opacity/Alpha Channel"
msgstr "Neprozirnost/alfa kanal"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity/alpha channel of the color."
msgstr "Neprozirnost/alfa kanal boje."

#: include/global_form.php lib/rrd.php
msgid "Consolidation Function"
msgstr "Funkcija konsolidacije"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented statistically on the graph."
msgstr "Kako su podaci za ovu stavku statistički prikazani na grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "CDEF Function"
msgstr "CDEF funkcija"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A CDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph or legend."
msgstr "CDEF (matematička) funkcija koja se primjenjuje na ovu stavku na grafu ili legendi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "VDEF Function"
msgstr "VDEF funkcija"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A VDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph legend."
msgstr "VDEF (matematička) funkcija koja se primjenjuje na ovu stavku na legendi grafa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Shift Data"
msgstr "Pomakni podatke"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Offset your data on the time axis (x-axis) by the amount specified in the 'value' field."
msgstr "Pomaknite svoje podatke na vremenskoj osi (osi x) za iznos naveden u polju 'value'."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "[HRULE|VRULE]: The value of the graph item.<br/> [TICK]: The fraction for the tick line.<br/> [SHIFT]: The time offset in seconds."
msgstr "[HRULE|VRULE]: Vrijednost stavke grafa.<br/> [TICK]: Udio za liniju oznake.<br/> [SHIFT]: Vremenski pomak u sekundama."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Type"
msgstr "GPRINT vrsta"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "If this graph item is a GPRINT, you can optionally choose another format here. You can define additional types under \"GPRINT Presets\"."
msgstr "Ako je ova stavka grafikona GPRINT, ovdje po želji možete odabrati drugi format. Dodatne tipove možete definisati pod \"GPRINT predefinisane postavke\"."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Alignment (TEXTALIGN)"
msgstr "Poravnanje teksta (TEXTALIGN)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "All subsequent legend line(s) will be aligned as given here.  You may use this command multiple times in a single graph.  This command does not produce tabular layout.<br/><strong>Note: </strong>You may want to insert a &lt;HR&gt; on the preceding graph item.<br/> <strong>Note: </strong>A &lt;HR&gt; on this legend line will obsolete this setting!"
msgstr "Svi sljedeći redovi legende bit će poravnati kako je ovdje navedeno.  Ovu naredbu možete koristiti više puta u jednom grafikonu.  Ova naredba ne pravi tabelarni raspored.<br/><strong>Napomena: </strong>Možda ćete željeti umetnuti &lt;HR&gt; na prethodnu stavku grafikona.<br/> <strong>Napomena: </strong>&lt;HR&gt; na ovom redu legende poništit će ovu postavku!"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Format"
msgstr "Format teksta"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text that will be displayed on the legend for this graph item."
msgstr "Tekst koji će se prikazati na legendi za ovu stavku grafa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Insert Hard Return"
msgstr "Umetni tvrdi prijelaz u novi red"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Forces the legend to the next line after this item."
msgstr "Prebacuje legendu u sljedeći red nakon ove stavke."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dashes (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"
msgstr "Crtice (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dashes modifier enables dashed line style."
msgstr "Modifikator dashes omogućuje isprekidani stil linije."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dash Offset (dash-offset=offset)"
msgstr "Pomak crtica (dash-offset=offset)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dash-offset parameter specifies an offset into the pattern at which the stroke begins."
msgstr "Parametar dash-offset određuje pomak u uzorku na kojem počinje crtanje poteza."

#: include/global_form.php lib/api_automation.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "Sequence"
msgstr "Slijed"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name given to this graph template."
msgstr "Naziv dan ovom predlošku grafa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Multiple Instances"
msgstr "Više instanci"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if there can be more than one Graph of this type per Device."
msgstr "Označite ovaj potvrdni okvir ako može postojati više od jednog grafa ove vrste po uređaju."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Test Data Sources"
msgstr "Testiraj izvore podataka"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Označite ovo polje za potvrdu ako želite testirati izvore podataka prije njihovog kreiranja.  Kada je testiranje izvora podataka omogućeno, ako izvor podataka ne vrati ispravne podatke, grafikon neće biti kreiran.  Ova postavka je važna ako želite imati općenitiji šablon uređaja koji može uključivati više šablona grafikona koji se mogu selektivno primijeniti u zavisnosti od karakteristika samog uređaja.  Napomena: ako kao izvor podataka imate skriptu koja dugo traje, vrijeme kreiranja grafikona bit će povećano."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a name for this graph item input, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Unesite naziv za ovaj ulaz stavke grafa, pazeći da je nešto što prepoznajete."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a description for this graph item input to describe what this input is used for."
msgstr "Unesite opis za ovaj ulaz stavke grafa koji opisuje čemu služi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Field Type"
msgstr "Vrsta polja"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data is to be represented on the graph."
msgstr "Kako se podaci prikazuju na grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "General Device Options"
msgstr "Opšte opcije uređaja"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Give this host a meaningful description."
msgstr "Dajte ovom hostu smislen opis."

#: include/global_form.php lib/api_automation.php managers.php pollers.php
#: user_admin.php user_group_admin.php
msgid "Hostname"
msgstr "Naziv hosta"

#: include/global_form.php
