msgstr "Onemogući RRDtool vodeni žig"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Provided your RRDtool version supports it, you may disable RRDtool advertisement on your Graphs by checking this option."
msgstr "Ako vaša verzija RRDtoola to podržava, označavanjem ove mogućnosti možete onemogućiti RRDtool reklamu na svojim grafovima."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Font Selection Method"
msgstr "Metoda odabira fontova"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How do you wish fonts to be handled by default?"
msgstr "Kako želite da se fontovima podrazumijevano rukuje?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/api_device.php
msgid "System"
msgstr "Sistem"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Font"
msgstr "Podrazumijevani font"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When not using Theme based font control, the Pango font description to use for all Graphs, such as DejaVu Sans. Optionally, you may leave blank and control font settings on a per object basis."
msgstr "Kada se ne koristi upravljanje fontovima temeljeno na temi, opis Pango fonta koji se koristi za sve grafove, na primjer DejaVu Sans. Po želji možete ostaviti prazno i upravljati postavkama fonta po objektu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Business Hours Settings"
msgstr "Postavke radnog vremena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Start of Business Day"
msgstr "Početak radnog dana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours start. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Vrijeme početka vašeg radnog vremena. Format: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "End of Business Day"
msgstr "Kraj radnog dana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The time your business hours end. Format: hh:mm"
msgstr "Vrijeme završetka vašeg radnog vremena. Format: hh:mm"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Weekends"
msgstr "Sakrij vikende"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Only show business hours during weekdays."
msgstr "Prikaži radno vrijeme samo radnim danima."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show business hours"
msgstr "Prikaži radno vrijeme"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Display business hours on rrd graphs."
msgstr "Prikaži radno vrijeme na rrd grafovima."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Color to use for business hours"
msgstr "Boja za radno vrijeme"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The color to be shown for business hours"
msgstr "Boja koja će se prikazivati za radno vrijeme"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of days to show business hours"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj dana za prikaz radnog vremena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "After this number of days, the business hours will not be added to the graph. <br/>Recommended: 62 days"
msgstr "Nakon ovog broja dana radno vrijeme neće se dodavati na graf. <br/>Preporučeno: 62 dana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Prikupljanje podataka omogućeno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Ako želite potpuno zaustaviti postupak prikupljanja, poništite ovaj okvir."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Podrška za SNMP agent omogućena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Kadupul will populate SNMP Agent tables with Kadupul device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Ako je ova opcija označena, Kadupul će popuniti tabele SNMP agenta informacijama o Kadupul uređajima i sistemu.  Ona ne omogućava sam SNMP agent."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Vrsta pollera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take effect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Vrsta pollera koja se koristi.  Ova će postavka stupiti na snagu pri sljedećem intervalu prikupljanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Interval sinhronizacije Pollera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Podrazumijevani interval sinhronizacije prikupljanja koji se koristi pri kreiranju pollera.  Ova postavka će uticati na to koliko se često udaljeni polleri provjeravaju i ažuriraju."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Interval prikupljanja koji se koristi.  Ova postavka će uticati na to koliko se često RRDfile datoteke provjeravaju i ažuriraju.  <strong><u>NAPOMENA: Ako promijenite ovu vrijednost, morate ponovo popuniti keš pollera.  Ako to ne učinite, može doći do gubitka podataka.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Interval Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Kadupul data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Kadupul data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Učestalost pokretanja Kadupul prikupljača podataka.  Za pokretanje Kadupul prikupljača podataka možete koristiti crontab, zakazani zadatak (za Windows) ili systemd servis cactid.  Upute za korištenje daemona cactid potražite u datoteci README.md u direktoriju service."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Uravnoteži opterećenje procesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Ako odaberete ovu mogućnost, Kadupul će pokušati uravnotežiti opterećenje svakog procesa pollera ravnomjernim raspoređivanjem stavki pollera po procesima."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Širina izlaza za otklanjanje pogrešaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Kadupul will check for output that exceeds Kadupul's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Ako odaberete ovu opciju, Kadupul će provjeravati izlaz koji premašuje Kadupulovu mogućnost pohrane i izdati upozorenje kada ga pronađe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Onemogući provjeru rastućeg OID-a"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Upravlja onemogućavanjem provjere rastućeg OID-a pri obilasku OID stabla."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena udaljenog agenta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Kadupul web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Kadupul Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Vrijeme u sekundama koje će centralni Kadupul web server čekati na odgovor udaljenog prikupljača podataka radi dobijanja raznih informacija o uređaju prije odustajanja od zahtjeva. Na uređajima koji su povezani s prikupljačima podataka različitim od centralnog Kadupul prikupljača podataka za prikupljanje informacija o uređaju mora se koristiti udaljeni agent."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Veličina dohvata za SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OIDs should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Koliko OID-ova treba vratiti po snmpbulkwalk zahtjevu?  Za uređaje s velikim SNMP stablima povećanje ove veličine poboljšat će performanse ponovnog indeksiranja preko WAN-a."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Ograničenje SNMP Get OID-ova"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Kadupul's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Podrazumijevani najveći broj SNMP Get OID-ova koji se šalju po snmpget zahtjevu. Za uređaje se ova postavka kontroliše na nivou uređaja. Ovu postavku trebate koristiti samo kada u svojim skriptama ili dodacima izvorno koristite Kadupul SNMP API."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Retention"
msgstr "Zadržavanje odbijenih uzoraka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hours that samples refused by RRDtool, for example after a data source schema change, stay queued for retry before they are moved to the poller_output_rejected table.  Repair the RRDfile, then run cli/replay_rejected_samples.php to process them."
msgstr "Sati tokom kojih uzorci koje RRDtool odbije, naprimjer nakon promjene šeme izvora podataka, ostaju u redu za ponovni pokušaj prije nego što se premjeste u tabelu poller_output_rejected.  Popravite RRDfile, a zatim pokrenite cli/replay_rejected_samples.php da biste ih obradili."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Rejected Sample Limit"
msgstr "Ograničenje odbijenih uzoraka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The most refused samples one data source may keep queued.  The oldest samples beyond this limit are moved to the poller_output_rejected table immediately."
msgstr "Najveći broj odbijenih uzoraka koje jedan izvor podataka može držati u redu čekanja.  Najstariji uzorci iznad ovog ograničenja odmah se premještaju u tabelu poller_output_rejected."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Onemogući replikaciju keša resursa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Kadupul Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Kadupul Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Podrazumijevano, glavni Kadupul prikupljač podataka kešira cijelu web stranicu i dodatke u keš resursa.  Zatim se udaljeni prikupljači podataka periodično ažuriraju svim izmjenama s glavnog Kadupul prikupljača podataka.  Ovaj keš resursa u suštini omogućava udaljenim prikupljačima podataka da se sami nadograde.  Ako ne želite koristiti ovu opciju, možete je onemogućiti ovom postavkom."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Dodatne postavke prikupljača podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Zapisivanje neispravnih podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Kako želite da se evidentiraju greške izlaza prikupljača podataka?  Opcije uključuju: 'Detailed' koja detaljno navodi svaku grešku, 'Summary' koja daje broj grešaka izlaza po uređaju i 'None' koja ne daje brojeve grešaka."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Sažetak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Detaljno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Broj PHP skript servera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Broj istovremenih procesa skript servera koji se pokreću po spine procesu.  Prihvataju se postavke između 1 i 15.  Ovaj parametar će pomoći ako pokrećete više niti i skripti skript servera, a važi samo za spine prikupljač podataka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Vrijednost isteka vremena skripte i skript servera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme koje će spine čekati da se skripta završi.  Ova vrijednost isteka vremena je u sekundama i vrijedi samo za spine prikupljač podataka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Periodično ponovno indeksiranje svih uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Raspored ponovnog indeksiranja svih uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Kojom učestalošću želite ponovno indeksirati sve uređaje.  Ovo ponovno indeksiranje odvijat će se u ponoć odabranom učestalošću."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Sedmično nedjeljom"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunday"
msgstr "Mjesečno nedjeljom"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Postavke isteka vremena pozadinskih zadataka i istodobnih procesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena generisanja izvještaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg Kadupul skripta za generisanje izvještaja može raditi bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prekida."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s minuta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena statistike izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg Kadupul skripta za statistiku izvora podataka može raditi bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prekida."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena RRDCheckera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg Kadupul skripta za provjeru RRDfile datoteka može raditi bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prekida."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s sat"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena naredbi pollera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg Kadupul skripta za pozadinske komande može raditi bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prekida.  Ova skripta obavlja zadatke kao što su ponovno indeksiranje uređaja i uklanjanje uređaja sa udaljenih prikupljača podataka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Istodobni procesi naredbi pollera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  There will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Broj istovremenih procesa komandi pollera.  U grupi komandi pollera biće najviše jedna istovremena komanda po hostu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 proces"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d procesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena pozadinskog generisanja održavanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg Kadupul skripta za održavanje može raditi bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prekida."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena pozadinskog generisanja Spikekilla"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Kadupul's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg Kadupul Spikekill skripta može raditi bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prekida."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Podrazumijevane postavke prikupljača podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Ove postavke se održavaju na nivou prikupljača podataka.  Vrijednosti ovdje su samo podrazumijevane vrijednosti koje se koriste pri prvom kreiranju prikupljača podataka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Procesi prikupljača podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Kadupul 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Podrazumijevani broj istovremenih procesa koji se izvršavaju po prikupljaču podataka. NAPOMENA: Od verzije Kadupul 1.2 ova postavka se održava u prikupljaču podataka. Ubuduće je ova vrijednost samo unaprijed podešena vrijednost za prikupljač podataka. Veći broj pri korištenju cmd.php poboljšat će performanse. Poboljšanja performansi u programu Spine najbolje se postižu parametrom threads. Pri korištenju programa Spine preporučujemo manji broj i korištenje niti umjesto toga. Pri korištenju cmd.php nemojte koristiti više od 2x broja CPU jezgri."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Niti po procesu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Kadupul 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Podrazumijevani broj niti dozvoljenih po procesu. NAPOMENA: Počevši od Kadupul 1.2+, ova postavka se održava u prikupljaču podataka, a ovo je samo unaprijed podešena vrijednost. Korištenje većeg broja uz Spine poboljšat će performanse. Međutim, osigurajte da imate dovoljno MySQL/MariaDB konekcija za sljedeću jednačinu: konekcije = prikupljači podataka * procesi * (niti + skript serveri). Također morate osigurati dovoljno slobodnih konekcija za korisničke prijave."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Metoda autentifikacije"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against an LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHP's LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Ugrađena autentifikacija</i> - Kadupul upravlja autentifikacijom korisnika, što vam omogućava kreiranje korisnika i dodjeljivanje prava za različita područja unutar sistema Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic autentifikacija</i> - Autentifikacijom upravlja web server. Korisnici se mogu dodati ili automatski kreirati pri prvoj prijavi ako je definisan šablonski korisnik, u suprotnom će se koristiti definisane dozvole gosta.<br><br><i>LDAP autentifikacija</i> - Omogućava autentifikaciju putem LDAP servera. Korisnici će biti automatski kreirani pri prvoj prijavi ako je definisan šablonski korisnik, u suprotnom će se koristiti definisane dozvole gosta.  Ako PHP-ov LDAP modul nije omogućen, LDAP autentifikacija se neće pojaviti kao opcija za odabir.<br><br><i>Autentifikacija na više LDAP/AD domena</i> - Omogućava administratorima da podrže pristup Kadupul resursima za više različitih grupa iz različitih LDAP/AD direktorija.  Kao i za LDAP autentifikaciju, za korištenje ove metode potreban je PHP LDAP modul.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Podrška za kolačiće autentifikacije"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Ako se korisnik autentifikuje i odabere 'Keep me signed in', na korisnikovom računaru će biti kreiran kolačić autentifikacije koji tom korisniku omogućava da ostane prijavljen.  Kolačić autentifikacije ističe nakon 90 dana nekorištenja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Posebni korisnici"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Primarni administrator"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Kadupul system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Naziv primarnog administrativnog računa koji će automatski primati e-poštu kada Kadupul sistem ima probleme.  Da biste primali ove poruke e-pošte, provjerite jesu li postavke pošte ispravne i ima li administrativni račun postavljenu adresu e-pošte."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Bez korisnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Gost korisnik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Ime gost korisnika za pregled grafikona; podrazumijevano je 'No User'."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Šablon korisnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Kadupul will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Ime korisnika kojeg će Kadupul koristiti kao šablon za nove Web Basic i LDAP korisnike; podrazumijevano je 'guest'.  Ovom korisničkom računu prijava će biti onemogućena nakon odabira."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Postavke osnovne autentifikacije"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Poruka o neuspjehu osnovne prijave"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Kadupul account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Pri upotrebi osnovne autentifikacije, ako postoje problemi s mapiranjem korisničkog imena na važeći Kadupul račun, ovdje navedena poruka bit će prikazana korisnicima.  Može sadržavati i tekst i HTML."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Mapfile osnovne autentifikacije"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Pri korištenju osnovne autentifikacije, ako je osnovni račun potrebno prevesti u drugi račun za prijavu, ovdje možete navesti CSV datoteku za mapiranje osnovnog računa na željeni račun za prijavu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi složenosti lokalnih računa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Minimalna dužina"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Ovo je minimalna dužina dozvoljenih lozinki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj velika i mala slova"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže i mala i velika slova."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj broj"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže najmanje 1 numerički znak."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj poseban znak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže najmanje 1 poseban znak."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Nametni složenost starim lozinkama"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da sve stare lozinke pri prijavi također zadovolje nove zahtjeve složenosti.  Ako ih ne zadovolje, bit će nametnuta promjena lozinke."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Istek neaktivnih računa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Ovo je maksimalan broj dana prije nego što se neaktivni računi onemoguće.  Administratorski račun izuzet je iz ove politike."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Istek lozinke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Ovo je maksimalan broj dana prije nego što lozinka istekne."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Historija lozinki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Zapamti ovoliko starih lozinki i zabrani njihovo ponovno korištenje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Change"
msgstr "1 promjena"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "%d promjena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Locking"
msgstr "Zaključavanje računa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock Accounts"
msgstr "Zaključaj račune"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock an account after this many failed attempts in 1 hour."
msgstr "Zaključaj račun nakon ovoliko neuspjelih pokušaja u 1 satu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Attempt"
msgstr "1 pokušaj"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Attempts"
msgstr "%d pokušaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Automatsko otključavanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "Račun će se automatski otključati nakon ovoliko minuta.  Čak i ako se unese ispravna lozinka, račun se neće otključati dok ovo vremensko ograničenje ne istekne.  Maksimalno 1440 minuta (1 dan)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 dan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP General Settings"
msgstr "Opšte postavke LDAP-a"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Server(s)"
msgstr "Server(i)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Kadupul will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user."
msgstr "Spisak DNS naziva hostova ili IP adresa ispravnih LDAP servera odvojenih razmacima.  Kadupul će pokušati koristiti LDAP servere s lijeva nadesno za autentifikaciju korisnika."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port Standard"
msgstr "Standardni port"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for Non-SSL communications including LDAP + TLS.  Default is 389."
msgstr "TCP port za komunikaciju bez SSL-a, uključujući LDAP + TLS. Podrazumijevano je 389."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port SSL"
msgstr "SSL port"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for LDAPS for SSL communications.  Default is 636."
msgstr "TCP port za LDAPS za SSL komunikaciju. Podrazumijevano je 636."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Protocol Version"
msgstr "Verzija protokola"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Protocol Version to connect to the server with."
msgstr "Verzija protokola kojom se povezuje sa serverom."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena povezivanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Istek vremena mrežnog povezivanja u sekundama."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bind Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena bind-a"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Bind Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Istek vremena bind-a u sekundama."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP Debug Mode"
msgstr "LDAP način otklanjanja pogrešaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Kadupul will log extra LDAP information to the Kadupul log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, Kadupul će u Kadupul zapisnik upisivati dodatne LDAP informacije tokom povezivanja (bind) i pretraživanja."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Šifriranje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Encryption that the server supports. NOTE: When using LDAP + TLS you must use version 3."
msgstr "Šifriranje koje server podržava. NAPOMENA: Kada koristite LDAP + TLS, morate koristiti verziju 3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi TLS certifikata"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should LDAP verify TLS Certificates when received by the Client.  Demand and Hard refuse a server whose certificate does not verify.  Never and Allow skip that check, so anyone on the network path can pose as the directory and read the passwords sent to it."
msgstr "Da li LDAP treba verifikovati TLS certifikate koje primi klijent.  Demand i Hard odbijaju server čiji certifikat nije verifikovan.  Never i Allow preskaču tu provjeru, tako da se bilo ko na mrežnoj putanji može predstaviti kao direktorij i pročitati lozinke koje mu se šalju."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Preusmjeravanja"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "Omogućite ili onemogućite LDAP preusmjeravanja.  Ako je onemogućeno, može povećati brzinu pretraživanja."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Način"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN)."
msgstr "Režim kojim će cacti pokušati izvršiti autentifikaciju na LDAP serveru.<blockquote><i>Bez pretrage</i> - Ne vrši se pretraga razlikovnog imena (DN), samo se pokušava povezivanje sa navedenim formatom razlikovnog imena (DN).<br><br><i>Anonimna pretraga</i> - Pokušava pretražiti korisničko ime u LDAP direktoriju putem anonimnog povezivanja radi pronalaženja korisnikovog razlikovnog imena (DN).<br><br><i>Specifična pretraga</i> - Pokušava pretražiti korisničko ime u LDAP direktoriju putem određenog razlikovnog imena (DN) i određene lozinke za povezivanje radi pronalaženja korisnikovog razlikovnog imena (DN)."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Distinguished Name (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Sintaksa \"Distinguished Name\", primjenjiva i na OpenLDAP i na Windows AD konfiguracije, nudi fleksibilnost u definisanju identiteta korisnika. Za OpenLDAP format prati ovu strukturu: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD pruža alternativnu sintaksu: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, opštepoznatu kao \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". U ovom kontekstu \"&lt;username&gt;\" predstavlja konkretno korisničko ime uneseno prilikom prijave. Ovo je posebno važno pri radu u režimu \"Bez pretraživanja\" ili kada je omogućeno \"Zahtijevaj članstvo u grupi\"."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj članstvo u grupi"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause authentication failure."
msgstr "Zahtijevaj da korisnik bude član grupe radi autentifikacije. Za to moraju biti postavljene postavke grupe, a omogućavanje bez ispravnih postavki grupe uzrokovat će neuspjeh autentifikacije."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Group Settings"
msgstr "Postavke LDAP grupe"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Distinguished Name (DN) grupe"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "Distinguished Name grupe u kojoj korisnik mora biti član."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Atribut člana grupe"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Odnosi se na određeni atribut u LDAP direktoriju koji sadrži korisnička imena članova grupe. Ključno je osigurati da vrijednost atributa odgovara konfiguraciji navedenoj u \"Distinguished Name\" ili da se stvarna vrijednost atributa može pretraživati pomoću postavki navedenih u \"Distinguished Name\"."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "Vrsta člana grupe"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "Definiše da li korisnici koriste puni Distinguished Name ili samo korisničko ime u definisanom atributu člana grupe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Distinguished Name"
msgstr "Distinguished Name"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Specific Search Settings"
msgstr "Postavke specifičnog LDAP pretraživanja"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Baza pretraživanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> or <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."
msgstr "Baza pretraživanja za pretraživanje LDAP direktorija, kao što je <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> ili <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "Filter pretrage"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt. "
msgstr "Filter pretrage koji se koristi za pronalaženje korisnika u LDAP direktoriju, kao na primjer za Windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> ili za OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' se zamjenjuje korisničkim imenom koje je uneseno pri zahtjevu za prijavu. "

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Distinguished Name (DN) pretraživanja"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Distinguished Name za bind specifičnog pretraživanja na LDAP direktorij."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Password"
msgstr "Lozinka pretraživanja"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Password for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Lozinka za bind specifičnog pretraživanja na LDAP direktorij."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP CN Settings"
msgstr "Postavke LDAP CN-a"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Full Name when creating a new user, taken from LDAP. (on windows: displayname) "
msgstr "Polje koje će zamijeniti puno ime pri stvaranju novog korisnika, preuzeto iz LDAP-a. (na Windowsima: displayname) "

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-mail"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Email taken from LDAP. (on windows: mail)"
msgstr "Polje koje će zamijeniti e-mail preuzet iz LDAP-a. (na Windowsima: mail)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL Linking"
msgstr "Povezivanje URL-ova"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Server Base URL"
msgstr "Osnovni URL servera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the server location that will be used for links to the Kadupul site. This should include the subdirectory if Kadupul does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Ovo je lokacija servera koja će se koristiti za linkove prema Kadupul stranici. Ovo treba uključivati poddirektorij ako se Kadupul ne pokreće iz korijenskog foldera."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti slanja e-pošte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Notify Primary Admin of Issues"
msgstr "Obavijesti primarnog administratora o problemima"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In cases where the Kadupul server is experiencing problems, should the Primary Administrator be notified by Email?  The Primary Administrator's Kadupul user account is specified under the Authentication tab on Kadupul's settings page. It defaults to the 'admin' account."
msgstr "U slučajevima kada Kadupul server ima problema, treba li primarnog administratora obavijestiti e-poštom?  Kadupul korisnički račun primarnog administratora naveden je na kartici Autentifikacija na Kadupul stranici postavki. Podrazumijevano je račun 'admin'."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Test Email"
msgstr "Testni e-mail"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is an Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "Ovo je e-mail račun koji se koristi za slanje testne poruke radi provjere radi li sve ispravno."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mail Services"
msgstr "Poštanske usluge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which mail service to use in order to send mail"
msgstr "Koja će se poštanska usluga koristiti za slanje pošte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Mail Server"
msgstr "Pinguj server pošte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping the Mail Server before sending test Email?"
msgstr "Pingovati server pošte prije slanja probne e-pošte?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "E-mail adresa pošiljaoca"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Ovo je e-mail adresa s koje će e-mail izgledati poslan."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Ime pošiljaoca"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Ovo je stvarno ime s kojeg će e-mail izgledati poslan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Word Wrap"
msgstr "Prijelom riječi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "Ovo je broj znakova koji su dozvoljeni prije nego što se red u e-poruci automatski prelomi. (0 = Onemogućeno)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Sendmail Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti Sendmaila"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/functions.php
msgid "Sendmail Path"
msgstr "Putanja Sendmaila"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "Ovo je putanja do sendmaila na vašem serveru. (Koristi se samo ako je Sendmail odabran kao usluga pošte)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti SMTP-a"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Hostname"
msgstr "SMTP naziv hosta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "Ovo je naziv hosta/IP adresa SMTP servera na koji ćete slati e-poruku. Za prebacivanje u slučaju kvara (failover), razdvojite svoje hostove tačkom i zarezom."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Port"
msgstr "SMTP port"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The port on the SMTP Server to use."
msgstr "Port na SMTP serveru koji se koristi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Username"
msgstr "SMTP korisničko ime"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The username to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Korisničko ime za autentifikaciju pri slanju putem SMTP-a. (Ostavite prazno ako ne zahtijevate autentifikaciju.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Password"
msgstr "SMTP lozinka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Lozinka za autentifikaciju pri slanju putem SMTP-a. (Ostavite prazno ako ne zahtijevate autentifikaciju.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Security"
msgstr "SMTP sigurnost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The encryption method to use for the Email."
msgstr "Metod šifriranja koji se koristi za e-poštu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SSL"
msgstr "SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS"
msgstr "TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Timeout"
msgstr "SMTP istek vremena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the SMTP timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Unesite SMTP istek vremena u sekundama."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Reporting Presets"
msgstr "Predefinisane postavke izvještavanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Graph Image Format"
msgstr "Podrazumijevani format slike grafikona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating a new report, what image type should be used for the inline graphs?"
msgstr "Pri kreiranju novog izvještaja, koju vrstu slike treba koristiti za ugrađene grafikone?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Email Size"
msgstr "Maksimalna veličina e-maila"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the Email message including all attachments."
msgstr "Maksimalna veličina e-mail poruke uključujući sve privitke."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Logging Level for Kadupul Reporting"
msgstr "Nivo evidentiranja Pollera za Kadupul izvještavanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file? WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Koji nivo detalja želite slati u datoteku zapisnika? UPOZORENJE: Ostavljanje na bilo kojem drugom statusu osim NONE ili LOW može brzo iscrpiti prostor na disku."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Lotus Notes (R) tweak"
msgstr "Omogući Lotus Notes (R) prilagodbu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable code tweak for specific handling of Lotus Notes Mail Clients."
msgstr "Omogućuje prilagodbu koda za posebno rukovanje klijentima e-pošte Lotus Notes."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Options"
msgstr "Mogućnosti DNS-a"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Primarna IP adresa DNS-a"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the primary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Unesite primarnu IP adresu DNS-a koja će se koristiti za obrnuta pretraživanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Secondary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Sekundarna IP adresa DNS-a"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the secondary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Unesite sekundarnu IP adresu DNS-a koja će se koristiti za obrnuta pretraživanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Timeout"
msgstr "DNS istek vremena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds.  Kadupul uses a PHP based DNS resolver."
msgstr "Unesite DNS istek vremena u milisekundama.  Kadupul koristi DNS razrješivač temeljen na PHP-u."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Postavke RRD ažuriranja na zahtjev"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Omogući RRD ažuriranje na zahtjev"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Kadupul?  If you disable, this change will not take effect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this setting is required to be on."
msgstr "Treba li Boost omogućiti RRD ažuriranje na zahtjev u Kadupulu?  Ako onemogućite, ova promjena neće stupiti na snagu do sljedećeg ciklusa prikupljanja.  Kada imate udaljene prikupljače podataka, ova postavka mora biti uključena."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "RRD ažurirač na nivou sistema"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Prije nego što se RRD ažuriranje na zahtjev može očistiti, uvijek mora proći izvođenje pollera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Koliko često Boost treba ažurirati sve RRD-ove"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Kada omogućite boost, vaše RRD datoteke se ažuriraju samo kada ih korisnik zatraži ili kada istekne ovaj vremenski period."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Broj Boost procesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Broj istovremenih boost procesa koji se koriste za obradu svih RRD-ova u boost tabeli."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Processing Mode"
msgstr "Način obrade Boosta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Boost distributes RRD updates. Forked processes start the number of Boost processes above on every run. Message queue workers hand each partition to Messenger workers instead."
msgstr "Kako Boost raspoređuje RRD ažuriranja. Forkani procesi pokreću gore navedeni broj Boost procesa pri svakom izvođenju. Radnici reda poruka umjesto toga predaju svaku particiju Messenger radnicima."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Forked processes"
msgstr "Forkani procesi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Message queue workers"
msgstr "Radnici reda poruka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj zapisa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Ako izlazna boost tabela premaši ovu veličinu, u zapisima, izvršit će se ažuriranje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj stavki izvora podataka po prolazu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Radi optimizacije performansi, boost RRD ažurirač mora znati koliko stavki izvora podataka treba dohvatiti u jednom prolazu.  Pazite da ne postavite previsoku vrijednost jer performanse crtanja grafikona tokom većih ažuriranja mogu biti narušene.  Ako tokom ažuriranja naiđete na sporost grafikona ili prikupljanja, smanjite ovaj broj.  Podrazumijevana vrijednost je 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Maksimalna dužina argumenta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating system's Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Kada boost šalje naredbe ažuriranja RRDtoolu, ne smije premašiti maksimalnu dužinu argumenta operativnog sistema.  Ovo varira zavisno od operativnog sistema i nivoa kernela.  Na primjer: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ neograničeno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Ograničenje memorije za Boost i poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Maksimalna količina memorije za Kadupul poller i Boost poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme izvođenja skripte RRD ažuriranja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log."
msgstr "Ako boost poller premaši ovo vrijeme izvođenja, upozorenje će biti zapisano u cacti zapisnik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable direct population of poller_output_boost table"
msgstr "Omogući direktno popunjavanje tabele poller_output_boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enables direct insert of records into poller output boost which results in a 25% time reduction in each poll cycle."
msgstr "Omogućava direktno umetanje zapisa u poller output boost, što rezultira smanjenjem vremena za 25% u svakom ciklusu prikupljanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Debug Log"
msgstr "Boost zapisnik otklanjanja pogrešaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this field is non-blank, Boost will log RRDUpdate output from the boost poller process."
msgstr "Ako ovo polje nije prazno, Boost će zapisivati izlaz RRDUpdate iz boost poller procesa."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Image Caching"
msgstr "Predmemoriranje slika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Image Caching"
msgstr "Omogući predmemoriranje slika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should image caching be enabled?"
msgstr "Treba li omogućiti predmemoriranje slika?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Location for Image Files"
msgstr "Lokacija datoteka slika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Specify the location where Boost should place your image files.  These files will be automatically purged by the poller when they expire."
msgstr "Navedite lokaciju na koju Boost treba smjestiti vaše datoteke slika.  Poller će ove datoteke automatski očistiti kada isteknu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Sources Statistics"
msgstr "Statistika izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Data Source Statistics Collection"
msgstr "Omogući prikupljanje statistike izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Data Source Statistics be collected for this Kadupul system?"
msgstr "Da li treba prikupljati statistiku izvora podataka za ovaj Kadupul sistem?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of DSStats Processes"
msgstr "Broj DSStats procesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Broj istodobnih DSStats procesa koji se koriste za obradu svih izvora podataka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Daily Update Frequency"
msgstr "Učestalost dnevnog ažuriranja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequently should Daily Stats be updated?"
msgstr "Koliko često treba ažurirati dnevnu statistiku?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hourly Average Window"
msgstr "Prozor satnog prosjeka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Broj uzastopnih sati koji predstavljaju satni prosjek.  Imajte na umu da previsoka postavka može dovesti do veoma velikih memorijskih tabela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Time"
msgstr "Vrijeme održavanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What time of day should Weekly, Monthly, and Yearly Data be updated?  Format is HH:MM [am/pm]"
msgstr "U koje doba dana treba ažurirati sedmične, mjesečne i godišnje podatke?  Format je HH:MM [am/pm]"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Data Source Statistics Data Collector"
msgstr "Ograničenje memorije za prikupljač podataka statistike izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Kadupul Poller and Data Source Statistics Poller"
msgstr "Maksimalna količina memorije za Kadupul poller i poller statistike izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Native Alerting"
msgstr "Izvorno upozoravanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Native Alert Evaluation"
msgstr "Omogući izvornu evaluaciju upozorenja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should the main Data Collector evaluate alert rules after each polling cycle and send their notifications? Alert rules read the rates that Data Source Statistics collects, so Data Source Statistics Collection must also be enabled."
msgstr "Treba li glavni prikupljač podataka evaluirati pravila upozorenja nakon svakog ciklusa prikupljanja i slati njihove obavijesti? Pravila upozorenja čitaju stope koje prikuplja statistika izvora podataka pa mora biti omogućeno i prikupljanje statistike izvora podataka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alert Rules per Batch"
msgstr "Pravila upozorenja po seriji"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of alert rules read and evaluated together. The time budget is checked between batches."
msgstr "Broj pravila upozorenja koja se čitaju i evaluiraju zajedno. Vremenski proračun provjerava se između serija."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Rules"
msgstr "%d pravila"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alert Evaluation Time Budget"
msgstr "Vremenski proračun evaluacije upozorenja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How long one evaluation run may start new batches of rules. Sending queued notifications follows evaluation with the time left, and may send one batch even when the budget is spent. Rules not reached are evaluated first by the next run."
msgstr "Koliko dugo jedno izvođenje evaluacije može započinjati nove serije pravila. Slanje obavijesti u redu slijedi evaluaciju s preostalim vremenom i može poslati jednu seriju čak i kada je proračun potrošen. Pravila do kojih se nije stiglo evaluiraju se prva pri sljedećem izvođenju."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Provjera RRDfilea"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Omogući provjeru RRDfilea"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should RRDfile check be enabled for this Kadupul system?"
msgstr "Da li provjera RRDfile datoteka treba biti omogućena za ovaj Kadupul sistem?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of RRDfile Check Processes"
msgstr "Broj procesa provjere RRDfilea"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to process all of rrd files."
msgstr "Broj istodobnih procesa provjere RRDfilea koji se koriste za obradu svih rrd datoteka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check Frequency"
msgstr "Učestalost provjere"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequently should RRD be checked?"
msgstr "Koliko često treba provjeravati RRD?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Storage Settings"
msgstr "Postavke pohrane podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose if RRDs will be stored locally or being handled by an external RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Odaberite hoće li se RRD-ovi pohranjivati lokalno ili će njima upravljati vanjski RRDtool proxy server."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server"
msgstr "RRDtool Proxy server"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Structure RRDfile Paths"
msgstr "Strukturiraj putanje RRDfilea"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "Omogući strukturirane putanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each host's RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "Koristi zasebnu podmapu za RRD datoteke svakog hosta.  Imenovanje RRDfileova bit će jedno od sljedećeg:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Ovu promjenu možete napraviti nakon instalacije pokretanjem CLI skripte <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> nakon što promijenite postavku.  NAPOMENA: ako promijenite vrijednost Max Directories kako biste smanjili broj direktorija ili promijenite obrazac direktorija, prazni direktoriji neće biti uklonjeni nakon ponovnog pokretanja skripte <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b>."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Obrazac direktorija"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths?  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Koji obrazac direktorija želite koristiti za strukturirane RRD putanje?  'ID uređaja' je podrazumijevano.  Postavku 'ID uređaja/ID upita podataka' treba koristiti kada imate uređaje s hiljadama grafikona.  Nakon promjene obrasca direktorija morate ponovo pokrenuti CLI skriptu za strukturirane putanje kako biste modifikovali putanje RRDfile datoteka na novi obrazac."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "ID uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "ID uređaja/ID upita podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID"
msgstr "Hash uređaja/ID uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Hash uređaja/ID uređaja/ID upita podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Device Hash Directories"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj direktorija hasha uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of Device Directories to be created based upon hashed Device IDs."
msgstr "Maksimalan broj direktorija uređaja koji se stvaraju na temelju hashiranih ID-ova uređaja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Proxy server"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "DNS naziv hosta ili IP adresa RRDtool proksi servera."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Port Number"
msgstr "Broj proxy porta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication."
msgstr "TCP port za šifriranu komunikaciju."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "RSA otisak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Otisak trenutnog javnog RSA ključa koji proxy koristi. Potreban je za uspostavu pouzdane veze."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "RRDtool Proxy server - rezervni"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Uravnoteženje opterećenja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Ako su dostupni i glavni i pričuvni proxy, ova mogućnost omogućuje raspodjelu svih zahtjeva prema RRDtoolu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "DNS naziv hosta ili IP adresa rezervnog RRDtool proksi servera ako proksi radi u MSR režimu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "TCP port za šifriranu komunikaciju sa rezervnim proksijem."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Otisak trenutnog javnog RSA ključa koji pričuvni proxy koristi. Potreban je za uspostavu pouzdane veze."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Postavke uklanjanja šiljaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Metoda uklanjanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Postoje dvije metode uklanjanja.  Prva, standardna devijacija, uklonit će svaki uzorak koji je X standardnih devijacija udaljen od prosjeka uzoraka.  Druga metoda, varijanca, uklonit će svaki uzorak koji je za X% veći od prosjeka varijance.  Metoda varijance uzima u obzir određeni broj 'odstupajućih vrijednosti'.  To su iznimni uzorci, poput šiljka, koje je potrebno isključiti iz izračuna prosjeka varijance."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Standardna devijacija"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Temeljeno na varijanci uz uklonjene odstupajuće vrijednosti"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Metoda zamjene"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Postoje tri metode zamjene.  Prva metoda zamjenjuje šiljak prosjekom dotičnog izvora podataka.  Druga metoda zamjenjuje šiljak vrijednošću 'NaN'.  Posljednja zamjenjuje šiljak posljednjom pronađenom poznatom ispravnom vrijednošću."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Prosjek"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaNs"
msgstr "NaN vrijednosti"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Posljednja poznata ispravna"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Broj standardnih devijacija"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Svaka vrijednost koja je ovoliko standardnih devijacija iznad prosjeka bit će isključena.  Dobar broj ovisit će o vrsti podataka koji se obrađuju.  Preporučujemo broj ne manji od 5 standardnih devijacija."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "%d standardnih devijacija"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Procenat varijanse"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Ova vrijednost predstavlja procenat iznad prilagođenog prosjeka uzorka nakon što se odstupajuće vrijednosti uklone iz uzorka.  Na primjer, procenat varijanse od 100%% na prilagođenom prosjeku od 50 uklonio bi sa grafikona svaki uzorak iznad količine od 100."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Broj odstupajućih vrijednosti varijance"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples that will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Ova vrijednost predstavlja broj visokih i niskih prosječnih uzoraka koji će se ukloniti iz skupa uzoraka prije izračuna prosjeka varijance.  Ako odaberete vrijednost odstupanja 5, uklonit će se i gornjih i donjih 5 prosjeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d High/Low Samples"
msgstr "%d visokih/niskih uzoraka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj uklanjanja po RRA-u"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Ova vrijednost predstavlja maksimalan broj šiljaka koji se uklanjaju iz RRA-a grafa."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Spikes"
msgstr "%d šiljaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Backup Directory"
msgstr "Direktorij sigurnosnih kopija RRDfilea"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this directory is not empty, then your original RRDfiles will be backed up to this location."
msgstr "Ako ovaj direktorij nije prazan, vaši izvorni RRDfileovi bit će kopirani na ovu lokaciju."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Batch Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Postavke skupnog uklanjanja šiljaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Schedule"
msgstr "Raspored uklanjanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Do you wish to periodically remove spikes from your graphs?  If so, select the frequency below."
msgstr "Želite li povremeno uklanjati šiljke s grafova?  Ako da, odaberite učestalost u nastavku."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Once a Day"
msgstr "Jednom dnevno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Every Other Day"
msgstr "Svaki drugi dan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Base Time"
msgstr "Osnovno vrijeme"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Base Time for Spike removal to occur.  For example, if you use '12:00am' and you choose once per day, the batch removal would begin at approximately midnight every day."
msgstr "Osnovno vrijeme za uklanjanje šiljaka.  Na primjer, ako koristite '12:00am' i odaberete jednom dnevno, skupno uklanjanje počet će otprilike u ponoć svaki dan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Templates to Spike Kill"
msgstr "Predlošci grafova za uklanjanje šiljaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When performing batch spike removal, only the templates selected below will be acted on."
msgstr "Pri skupnom uklanjanju šiljaka obradit će se samo predlošci odabrani u nastavku."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Backup Retention"
msgstr "Zadržavanje sigurnosnih kopija"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When SpikeKill kills spikes in graphs, it makes a backup of the RRDfile.  How long should these backup files be retained?"
msgstr "Kada SpikeKill ukloni šiljke s grafova, izrađuje sigurnosnu kopiju RRDfilea.  Koliko dugo treba zadržati te sigurnosne kopije?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default View Mode"
msgstr "Podrazumijevani režim prikaza"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Graph mode do you want displayed by default when you first visit the Graphs page?"
msgstr "Koji režim grafikona želite da se podrazumijevano prikazuje kada prvi put posjetite stranicu grafikona?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TimeZone Support"
msgstr "Podrška za vremenske zone"

#: include/global_settings.php
