#: lib/installer.php
msgid "MySQL - TimeZone Support"
msgstr "MySQL - podrška za vremenske zone"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your MySQL TimeZone database is not populated.  Please populate this database before proceeding."
msgstr "Vaša MySQL baza podataka vremenskih zona nije popunjena.  Popunite ovu bazu podataka prije nastavka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Kadupul database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Kadupul database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "Vaš račun za prijavu na Kadupul bazu podataka nema pristup MySQL bazi podataka vremenskih zona.  Dodijelite računu Kadupul baze podataka \"select\" pristup tabeli \"time_zone_name\" u bazi podataka \"mysql\" i popunite MySQL informacije o vremenskim zonama prije nastavka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Kadupul database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "Vaš račun Kadupul baze podataka ima pristup MySQL bazi podataka vremenskih zona i ta je baza podataka popunjena globalnim informacijama o vremenskim zonama."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "MySQL - Settings"
msgstr "MySQL - postavke"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Kadupul system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Ove postavke za podešavanje MySQL performansi pomoći će vašem Kadupul sistemu da duže radi bolje i bez problema."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Recommended MySQL System Variable Settings"
msgstr "Preporučene postavke MySQL sistemskih varijabli"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Installation Type"
msgstr "Vrsta instalacije"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Nadogradnja s <strong>%s</strong> na <strong>%s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, it is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Kadupul is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with Kadupul"
msgstr "U slučaju problema, toplo se preporučuje da očistite keš preglednika, zatvorite pa ponovo otvorite preglednik (ne samo karticu na kojoj je Kadupul) i pokušate ponovo, prije nego što prijavite problem Kadupulu"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "U rijetkim prilikama dobijali smo izvještaje od korisnika koji imaju manje probleme zbog promjena u kodu.  Ovi problemi nastaju jer preglednik zadržava kod prije nadogradnje, i iako smo preduzeli korake da smanjimo šanse za to, i dalje se može dogoditi.  Ako su vam potrebna uputstva kako da očistite keš preglednika, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> je dobra polazna tačka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Ako i nakon čišćenja keša i ponovnog pokretanja preglednika i dalje imate problema, prijavite nam problem i pokušat ćemo identifikovati njegov uzrok."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Vraćanje s <strong>%s</strong> na <strong>%s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Čini se da se vraćate na prethodnu verziju.  Promjene baze podataka napravljene za noviju verziju neće biti poništene i <i>mogle bi</i> uzrokovati probleme."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the type of installation"
msgstr "Odaberite vrstu instalacije"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Installation options:"
msgstr "Mogućnosti instalacije:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Choose this for the Primary site."
msgstr "Odaberite ovo za primarnu lokaciju."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "New Primary Server"
msgstr "Novi primarni server"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "New Remote Poller"
msgstr "Novi udaljeni poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Pollers are used to access networks that are not readily accessible to the Primary site."
msgstr "Udaljeni polleri koriste se za pristup mrežama koje nisu lako dostupne primarnoj lokaciji."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following information has been determined from Kadupul's configuration file. If it is not correct, please edit \"include/config.php\" before continuing."
msgstr "Sljedeće informacije utvrđene su iz Kadupulove konfiguracijske datoteke. Ako nisu ispravne, uredite \"include/config.php\" prije nastavka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Local Database Connection Information"
msgstr "Informacije o vezi s lokalnom bazom podataka"

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database: <b>%s</b>"
msgstr "Baza podataka: <b>%s</b>"

