#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MySQL 5.6+ and MariaDB 10.0+ are great releases, and are very good versions to choose. Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "MySQL 5.6+ i MariaDB 10.0+ su odlična izdanja i veoma dobre verzije za izbor. Obavezno koristite najnovije izdanje koje ispravlja dugogodišnji problem niskog nivoa mreže koji je spineu uzrokovao mnoge probleme sa pouzdanošću."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "Snažno se preporučuje omogućiti InnoDB u svakoj verziji %s većoj od 5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Pri korištenju Kadupula s jezicima koji nisu engleski važno je koristiti sortiranje utf8mb4_unicode_ci jer neki znakovi zauzimaju više od jednog bajta."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Pri korištenju Kadupula s jezicima koji nisu engleski važno je koristiti skup znakova utf8mb4 jer neki znakovi zauzimaju više od jednog bajta."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Preporučuje se omogućiti InnoDB u svakoj verziji %s većoj od 5.1."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Ovisno o broju prijava i korištenju spine prikupljača podataka, %s će trebati mnogo veza.  Izračun za spine je: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), a zatim morate ostaviti rezervu za korisničke veze, koja će se mijenjati ovisno o broju istodobnih korisničkih računa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means fewer file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Veći keš tabela znači manje operacija otvaranja/zatvaranja datoteka pri korištenju innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Uz mogućnosti udaljenog prikupljanja, velike količine podataka će se sinhronizovati s glavnog servera na udaljene pollere.  Stoga ovu vrijednost držite na 16M ili više."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Kadupul Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Ako koristite Kadupul Performance Booster i odaberete memorijski mehanizam pohrane, morate paziti da ispraznite međuspremnik Performance Boostera prije nego što sistemu ponestane prostora za memorijske tabele.  To se radi na dva načina: prvo smanjenjem veličine izlazne kolone na tačno potrebnu veličinu.  Ta kolona se nalazi u tabelama poller_output i poller_output_boost.  Drugo što možete uraditi jeste dodijeliti više memorije memorijskim tabelama.  Proizvoljno smo odabrali preporučenu vrijednost od 10%% sistemske memorije, ali ako koristite SSD diskove ili imate manji sistem, možete zanemariti ovu preporuku ili odabrati drugi mehanizam pohrane.  Očekivanu potrošnju tabela Performance Boostera možete vidjeti pod Konzola -> Sistemski alati -> Prikaži Boost status."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size keeps those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Pri izvršavanju podupita veća veličina privremene tabele zadržava te privremene tabele u memoriji."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and/or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Pri izvođenju spajanja, ako su ispod ove veličine, zadržat će se u memoriji i nikada neće biti zapisana u privremenu datoteku.  Budući da se radi o alokaciji memorije po vezi, treba paziti da se ne poveća previše.  Zbir join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + osnovna MySQL/MariaDB memorija treba biti ispod 80%.  Ako je preporuka negativna, morate smanjiti ovu vrijednost i/ili sort_buffer_size dok se preporuka ne uklopi u dozvoljenu memoriju."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Kada koristite InnoDB pohranu, važno je držati prostore tabela odvojenim.  To pojednostavljuje upravljanje tabelama dugogodišnjim korisnicima sistema %s.  Ako vam je ova opcija trenutno isključena, možete migrirati na pohranu po datoteci omogućavanjem ove funkcionalnosti, a zatim pokretanjem alter naredbe na svim InnoDB tabelama."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Kadupul tables."
msgstr "Pri upotrebi innodb_file_per_table važno je postaviti innodb_file_format na Barracuda.  Ova postavka će omogućiti duže indekse važne za određene Kadupul tabele."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that cannot properly create tables."
msgstr "Ako vaše tabele imaju veoma velike indekse, morate raditi sa Barracuda innodb_file_format i innodb_large_prefix jednakim 1.  U suprotnom dodaci možda neće moći ispravno kreirati tabele."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as many tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your system's total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your system's size."
msgstr "InnoDB će držati što više tabela i indeksa u sistemskoj memoriji.  Stoga innodb_buffer_pool trebate postaviti dovoljno velikim da u memoriji drži što više tabela i indeksa.  Provjera veličine direktorija /var/lib/mysql/cacti pomoći će u određivanju te vrijednosti.  Preporučujemo 25%% ukupne memorije vašeg sistema, ali vaši će se zahtjevi razlikovati zavisno od veličine sistema."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This setting should remain ON unless your Kadupul instance is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Ova postavka treba ostati UKLJUČENA (ON) osim ako vaša Kadupul instanca ne radi na ZFS-u ili FusionI/O-u koji oba imaju unutrašnje vođenje dnevnika za slučaj naglih padova sistema.  Međutim, ako imate veoma dobro napajanje, vaši sistemi rijetko padaju i imate sigurnosne kopije, isključivanje (OFF) ove postavke može vam donijeti gotovo 50% veće performanse baze podataka."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Ovdje se čuvaju metapodaci. Ako imate mnogo tabela, bilo bi korisno povećati ovu vrijednost."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not cause the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Neispravni upiti ne bi trebali uzrokovati da baza podataka postane nedostupna drugima. Prekinite ove upite prije nego što sruše vaš sistem."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Maksimalne I/O performanse postižu se korištenjem metode O_DIRECT za pražnjenje stranica."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Postavljanje ove vrijednosti na 2 znači da ćete prazniti sve transakcije svake sekunde umjesto pri potvrdi.  Ovo omogućava sistemu %s da rjeđe vrši pisanje."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Uz modernu SSD pohranu, više io niti predstavlja prednost za aplikacije s visokim io karakteristikama."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Od %s %s možete kontrolisati koliko često %s prazni transakcije na disk.  Podrazumijevana vrijednost je 1 sekunda, ali u sistemima s visokim I/O opterećenjem postavljanje na vrijednost veću od 1 može omogućiti sekvencijalniji I/O diska"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Uz modernu SSD pohranu, više io niti za čitanje predstavlja prednost za aplikacije s visokim io karakteristikama.  U zavisnosti od vaših MariaDB/MySQL verzija, ova vrijednost može ići do 64.  Ipak, pokušajte držati broj manjim od ukupnog broja SMT niti na serveru baze podataka."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Uz modernu SSD pohranu, više io niti za pisanje predstavlja prednost za aplikacije s visokim io karakteristikama.  U zavisnosti od vaših MariaDB/MySQL verzija, ova vrijednost može ići do 64.  Ipak, pokušajte držati broj manjim od ukupnog broja SMT niti na serveru baze podataka."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s će podijeliti innodb_buffer_pool u memorijska područja radi poboljšanja performansi za verzije MariaDB-a starije od 10.5.  Maksimalna vrijednost je 64, ali ne bi smjela premašiti broj CPU jezgri/niti.  Kada je vaš innodb_buffer_pool manji od 1GB, trebali biste koristiti veličinu međuspremnika podijeljenu s 128MB.  Nastavite koristiti ovu jednadžbu do maksimuma broja CPU jezgri ili 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL up to and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s će podijeliti innodb_buffer_pool u memorijska područja radi poboljšanja performansi za verzije MySQL-a do uključivo MySQL 8.0.  Maksimalna vrijednost je 64, ali ne bi smjela premašiti broj CPU jezgri/niti.  Kada je vaš innodb_buffer_pool manji od 1GB, trebali biste koristiti veličinu međuspremnika podijeljenu s 128MB.  Nastavite koristiti ovu jednadžbu do maksimuma broja CPU jezgri ili 64."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Ako imate SSD diskove, koristite ovaj prijedlog.  Ako imate fizičke tvrde diskove, koristite 200 * broj aktivnih diskova u nizu.  Ako koristite NVMe ili PCIe Flash, mogu se koristiti mnogo veći brojevi, do 100000."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Ako imate SSD diskove, koristite ovaj prijedlog.  Ako imate fizičke tvrde diskove, koristite 2000 * broj aktivnih diskova u nizu.  Ako koristite NVMe ili PCIe Flash, mogu se koristiti mnogo veći brojevi, do 200000."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "Ako imate SSD diskove, koristite ovaj prijedlog. U suprotnom nemojte postavljati ovu postavku."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Uz modernu SSD pohranu, više io niti za čitanje predstavlja prednost za aplikacije s visokim io karakteristikama."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Uz modernu SSD pohranu, više io niti za pisanje predstavlja prednost za aplikacije s visokim io karakteristikama."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Pri korištenju MariaDB 10.2.4 i novijih ova postavka treba biti isključena ako su omogućeni atomarni zapisi.  Stoga umjesto double write međuspremnika omogućite atomarne zapise jer će to povećati performanse."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Pri korištenju MariaDB 10.2.4 i novijih možete koristiti atomarne zapise umjesto doublewrite međuspremnika radi povećanja performansi."

