#: utilities.php
msgid "The Kadupul Log stores statistics, error and other messages depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Kadupul zapisnik čuva statistiku, greške i druge poruke zavisno od postavki sistema. Ove informacije se mogu koristiti za identifikovanje problema s pollerom i aplikacijom."

